<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβῐβ-άζω</span></b> , causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβαίνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry over</i> or <i>across,
				transport, lead over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸν στρατὸν κατὰ γεφύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν νῆσον ὁπλίτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			: also c. acc. loci, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμὸν δ.
			[τινά</span>] <i>take</i> one <i>across</i> a river, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				900c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπὶ τὰ ὁμοειδῆ τὸ χρήσιμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					2.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.Cit.
				1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				28(49).29
			</span></i>; <i>lead</i> to a conclusion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἰς πέρας τῷ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.24
				</span></i>
			: in Music, <i>cause</i> the melody <i>to pass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὴν παρυπάτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1134f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κλήρους</span>
			<i>pass through</i> the heats or rounds of an athletic contest, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JRS</u>
				3.282
			</span></i> (Antioch in Pisidia). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of Verbs, <i>have a transitive force,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				277.10
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> later,
				<i>pass time,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				847
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
